## No allocation by the wrapper; any raylib buffer is copied and released before returning.
##
## ## Example
## ```pengu
## var idx as maybe int is calling text_find with "hello", "l"
## ```

weave text_find with text as string, search as string into maybe int:
    let c_text as ref to frozen char is calling ffi.cstr_from_string with text
    let c_search as ref to frozen char is calling ffi.cstr_from_string with search
    var idx as int is calling raylib.TextFindIndex with c_text, c_search
    if idx < 0:
        return maybe none
    return some idx

